<title>SOUTH AFRICA: IMPLATS SEES INCREASED EARNINGS.</title>
<headline>IMPLATS SEES INCREASED EARNINGS.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Impala Platinum Holdings Ltd said on Thursday it was well-poised to benefit from improved metal prices and to further increase earnings in the present financial year.</p>
</text>
